  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n8k6 + 15k3 – 2 = 0\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet, k3 = x\n\nSo, 8x² + 15x - 2 = 0\n\n⇒ 8x2 + 16x - x - 2 = 0\n\n⇒ 8x (x + 2) - 1 (x + 2) = 0\n\n⇒ (8x - 1) (x + 2) = 0\n\n⇒ 8x - 1 = 0 ⇒ x = 1/8\n\n⇒ x + 2 = 0 ⇒ x = - 2 [Not possible because of negative value]\n\nNow, k3 = 1/8\n\n⇒ k = 1/2 ⇒ 1/k = 2\n\nThen, (k + 1/k) = (1/2 + 2) = 5/2 = 2(1)/(2)\n\n**∴ The value of (k + 1/k) is 2(1)/(2)**",
